{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜と朝が寒すぎてホッカイロを3枚貼りして、手に2つ持って暖められています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホッカイロありがとう⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月が近づくとテレビが夜中まで面白いので幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ウエットシートを買ったけど、間違えて思いっきり周りのビニール切ってしまって、ただのティッシュになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ1枚も使ってないのに。(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の欅って、書けない?お化け屋敷でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に怖かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななこごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前近くで東京タワーを見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり間近でみるととっても綺麗でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は登ってみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お笑い芸人の小籔千豊さんにハマってます。カズニョロさん。\nカズニョロポーズを一緒にしてみたいです⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0W7DQSYNXFWTHCNVEWEZ2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}